  "notes": "USAGE:\nA practical word common in business and daily life. Used for restocking goods, replenishing supplies, and filling personnel vacancies.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {補給|ほきゅう}: supply, replenishment (often military or large-scale logistics)\n- {補充|ほじゅう}: replenishment, restocking (general filling of shortages)\n- {補填|ほてん}: compensation, making up for a deficit (especially financial)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {在庫|ざいこ}を{補充|ほじゅう}する: to restock inventory\n- {人員|じんいん}を{補充|ほじゅう}する: to supplement personnel\n- {補充|ほじゅう}{要員|よういん}: replacement personnel",
